  "summary": "Russian GPU cloud with immersion-cooled servers. Prices are listed in roubles per hour for whole virtual machines (disk and IP address included), billed from a prepaid balance; the company states it is exempt from VAT, so none is added. Each card shows the machine with the lowest price per GPU, often a multi-GPU one. The dollar figure uses the Bank of Russia's official rate of the day.",
